  "title": "Now Live: The Common Fund Data Ecosystem (CFDE) Knowledge Center Resource",
  "summary": "We are thrilled to announce the public launch of the Common Fund Data Ecosystem (CFDE) Knowledge Center, available at cfdeknowledge.org. ",
  "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"text-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><em><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Open access CFDE program knowledge, analysis tools, workflows, and more</span></em></p><p class=\"text-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;border:medium;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:inline-block;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;height:264px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;width:456px;\"><img style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcd12wz913k1LKDZcBY_gmVCaLLYZ7o5Iw1KjxX3AV3YSZ846bsyUgPv7OyXeaPFnnWO7xgth28exuJTFHYpM1h_7FWlClZps3xZf5sss4XbO5OQqD6Kf_y5b25v0A4_2VGemR_-SVKY4ERTXkrkq6_kSLp?key=Lbgf-ISZnakPlXCBQgxXpg\" width=\"465.5104281009879\" height=\"264\" loading=\"lazy\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Visit the CFDE Knowledge Center Portal</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are thrilled to announce the public launch of the Common Fund Data Ecosystem (CFDE) Knowledge Center, available at</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong> </strong></span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"http://cfdeknowledge.org/\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong><u>cfdeknowledge.org</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>. </strong></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The CFDE Knowledge Center, developed by the Knowledge Portal team, aims to improve visibility and understanding of CFDE resources and to generate knowledge by analyzing CFDE data. </span></p><p> </p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Sneak Preview</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Through cutting-edge analytic tools and visualization interfaces, users can now search within and across Common Fund datasets to answer diverse biological questions. Some capabilities include:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Learn about CFDE programs and why they are useful to your area of interest</span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">View research webinars </span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Analyze genes and phenotypes</span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Identify differential gene expression patterns</span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Perform cross-program analyses of gene sets and their relationships to human phenotypes</span></li></ul><p> </p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Learn more by visiting us at ASHG 2024!</strong></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ASHG Exhibition Booth #571, November 6-8</span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ASHG Ancillary Session: A Human Geneticists’ Guide to the Common Fund Data Ecosystem </span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wednesday, November 6 11:45am-1:15pm</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Colorado Convention Center, Room 708</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ASHG Ancillary Session: MoTrPAC Data Hub: A Hands-On Experience Exploring the Molecular Map of Exercise </span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wednesday, November 6, 7-9pm</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hyatt Regency Hotel, Granite Room</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ASHG Ancillary Session: Kids First New Research Gold Rush, CFDE Poster</span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thursday, November 7, 7-9 pm</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hyatt Regency Denver at Colorado Convention Center, Room Centennial F</span></p><p> </p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>What is the Common Fund Data Ecosystem?</strong></span></p><p class=\"text-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Common Fund Data Ecosystem (CFDE) promotes accessibility, (re)use, and integration of multi-program Common Fund data and resources. CFDE program resources span common and rare diseases and open doors for innovative computational and experimental research.</span></p><p class=\"text-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;border:medium;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:inline-block;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;height:277px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;width:312px;\"><img style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:-27.531396px;\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe3KkTXeWRpRRCPr_B18eboD2gBF43fQiEJ0nNdzodcZhyMBK25Ah81mDA9ThAVUiedNA83KiMPxqLjkGgLC7XNEm4jdvkph9_BRQXKPbuHq-hvD1CXfAlgMns7R3TDepTxyF35NAp1Q5JJ92__zV4AKtlq?key=Lbgf-ISZnakPlXCBQgxXpg\" width=\"312\" height=\"348.23654114383766\" loading=\"lazy\" /></span></p><p class=\"text-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><em><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-ligatures:nor